<h2 local-id=3D"8a6f11ea6d53" id=3D"FIONA_IntegrationFailureManagement_BRD_=
V1.0-6.High-LevelBusinessRequirements">6. High-Level Business Requirements<=
/h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1046" data-layout=3D"align-start" data-local-id=
