<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"28af62d5-7656-4833-8975-25a77a87c863">
<th data-local-id=3D"fdb41c2a-7ec3-40c4-a6b9-870a7aded2bd" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"6c862b624781"><strong>ID</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"e125853b-53a3-4184-ba0f-f6ec5eae4bd9" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"92fe9180e32a"><strong>Requirement</strong></p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"571617d6-0f9e-44e6-a444-bd40cd8133c0">
<td data-local-id=3D"26145464-d9c6-4a6d-a3da-1b9a4ceaf6ff" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c674082d17f1">BR=E2=80=9101</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"6fb502b0-3ffa-40b5-9558-6424a59b0d84" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c41b571a59e2">The system shall allow Finance Systems (FS) te=
chnicians to capture integration failure details via a data entry form</p><=
/td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"5e2502b0-9210-4f40-9e6c-84d0b7f39ddf">
<td data-local-id=3D"00e27c4e-a306-4080-abf4-2a10aeac8793" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"cd7148a5099f">BR=E2=80=9102</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"bc674d8b-9e66-422a-887f-0e6f6fb74bdb" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1a6de03cf2bc">The system shall create a new failure record w=
ith status <strong>=E2=80=9COpen=E2=80=9D</strong> upon form submission</p>=
</td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"9c6a966a-02be-40bf-949d-caafbb0216f7">
<td data-local-id=3D"f0f722c4-0c59-44dc-b400-72ad1d0fe224" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"27d46967a7ed">BR=E2=80=9103</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3539658b-4950-4682-a320-9b07a211e47e" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"61b218f5164d">The system shall automatically trigger an emai=
l notification from the technician to the Finance Systems mailbox upon reco=
rd creation</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"7be9d11f-fc21-4e0b-9f30-eddecd9e849a">
<td data-local-id=3D"3cad4171-0d32-45af-8011-facae7c825cc" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1b069368dab3">BR=E2=80=9104</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2ea7612a-bf23-4d35-9709-5b51037ea5cb" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8d1e4932bfba">The system shall require the technician to cap=
ture and update a <strong>ticket number (Halo ticket)</strong> against each=
 failure record</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"702f2bc5-dd41-43e1-a823-bec53a29ea0c">
<td data-local-id=3D"da16b843-c092-425a-84a7-25d9923484cb" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ab629ee0b958">BR=E2=80=9105</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"38f6c6e4-91fc-4c2e-b1fd-437d0eac7683" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bfc2d579e2a4">The system shall enable the <strong>Email gene=
ration</strong> action only after a ticket number is entered for the record=
</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"33f01957-8253-4e19-9564-dc9a48eee2c0">
<td data-local-id=3D"963af3cb-43e6-44a8-86ed-897f19cda610" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"95efcfa6c0ea">BR=E2=80=9106</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"059b41ea-c7d3-4bd4-9550-4718e74496f2" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1bfd18526691">The system shall allow technicians to log sing=
le/multiple failure records within a session before triggering single/bulk =
email actions</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"7759a4cb-bc2b-4517-ab41-0be6fb9c70fa">
<td data-local-id=3D"78061104-d2fd-4861-885a-e6ca5add9618" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f62bd3a6dd5b">BR=E2=80=9107</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"55628d64-3e8e-48be-aa72-e8c0d33c1fdc" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"dad1ee0233ca">The system shall generate emails based on pred=
efined <strong>failure type conditions and recipient mapping</strong></p></=
td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"2e1dbb1e-f9e8-4650-949b-aac677e3504b">
<td data-local-id=3D"f9453a0a-4c7a-4539-a3bc-341f251b1907" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b9cb546d64a3">BR=E2=80=9108</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"882e5ced-c318-42b9-b19d-9423e26cf65d" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d700a1acb516">The system shall send emails only for failure =
types mapped to <strong>Master Data team recipients</strong></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"9ffa4213-2f33-4dcd-8483-666adf6f2425">
<td data-local-id=3D"13bf2a2c-e3b2-44f7-b3db-000b4f1eb33f" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b9742a74065b">BR=E2=80=9109</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"afb2b245-fd8c-45cf-aa1d-c052c4ab58ba" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ee223b96aaab">The system shall not send emails for failure t=
ypes marked as <strong>=E2=80=9CNo email notification required=E2=80=9D</st=
rong></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"6cb1915b-7b11-41bf-bbeb-75fd9ef9bd52">
<td data-local-id=3D"77ac178f-81fe-4053-9df0-1af6cfc55e5f" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d5014a414878">BR=E2=80=9110</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c38ffee9-cee5-4d9a-bed9-0ba44001b772" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"807740b059dc">The system shall update the record status to <=
strong>=E2=80=9CWith Masterdata=E2=80=9D</strong> when an email is sent to =
Master Data users</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"397501e6-13a0-47ed-bc82-a49a28f6581d">
<td data-local-id=3D"a9e5c746-bab7-49d3-b5ac-06bb503590e7" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"81791cd2ccc7">BR=E2=80=9111</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e1a03663-9901-4989-9cd7-8957852a4c5f" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fe7a23f8a128">The system shall retain records in <strong>=E2=
=80=9CWith Finance Systems=E2=80=9D</strong> status where no Master Data ac=
tion is required</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"cbd80a6a-ddd8-4841-b324-68df9af8a061">
<td data-local-id=3D"241f3253-c6c8-4826-9aca-d437b5a68bde" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"12ed50e2a066">BR=E2=80=9112</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"41507262-820b-41e9-9d08-423fe1c669fe" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"991d1d80d4aa">The system shall provide a configurable mappin=
g of <strong>Failure Type =E2=86=92 Email Recipient</strong> (e.g., <a clas=
s=3D"external-link" href=3D"mailto:masterdata@marstonholdings.co.uk" rel=3D=
"nofollow">masterdata@marstonholdings.co.uk</a>)</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"5a4c8526-4583-4669-9626-618f736930ac">
<td data-local-id=3D"103bdf2b-6b24-4f5c-a809-659ad808658c" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"de6776e69ea3">BR=E2=80=9113</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8af5592a-a351-491e-ad11-b3b2d159be2c" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5b01bd547dbd">The system shall allow Master Data users to lo=
g into the portal and view failure records assigned to them</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"828af0f8-c362-4ae3-abd4-102822d2e322">
<td data-local-id=3D"f0f25370-ca0d-45d2-821b-1848f174f285" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1ba31523c0a5">BR=E2=80=9114</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0866731f-622a-45f8-9b6b-18f60e592b4e" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"dd46fd097aed">The system shall restrict Master Data users to=
 view or edit Finance System allocated failure records</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"305097f0a4b5">
<td data-local-id=3D"0851090f43c1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b4598c344cc1">BR=E2=80=9115</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"11f25c446fdf" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"77320a617b81">The system shall allow Master Data users to vi=
ew or add comments to other Master Data users failure records</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"6e84e6b3-4948-421a-b98b-2143ee2ba816">
<td data-local-id=3D"4f5b0cb6-8854-44e9-a0fc-a93440823035" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e9f6e8e11468">BR=E2=80=9116</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7518c02d-39fd-4647-9509-942a12f13f1e" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c85e6796d34e">The system shall allow Master Data users to up=
date only <strong>status and notes/comments</strong> fields</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"5fa4ec35-2850-4561-bd6b-95632bcca6bc">
<td data-local-id=3D"fa4aad92-c8dc-44f9-8809-26e5f091d14c" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"cc1a22f49e23">BR=E2=80=9117</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"74048b83-e06e-4e20-8e2f-e3b86555100d" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9fefa66edece">The system shall allow Master Data users to ch=
ange status from <strong>=E2=80=9CWith Masterdata=E2=80=9D to =E2=80=9CWith=
 Finance Systems=E2=80=9D</strong> after review</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"65da7944-11a7-45ad-a4f5-d9febe616bc7">
<td data-local-id=3D"0a6e2c03-2d2f-4088-9c63-04b81112d714" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e392c5e7fa70">BR=E2=80=9118</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e410687d-594f-4f91-9921-906f29968a06" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"75e802639744">The system should allow Master Data users to a=
dd optional notes/comments before passing records</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"332a1de3-4ce8-4ffa-b9f0-c38dae310b78">
<td data-local-id=3D"9fc09560-0316-4ab1-826a-6a4a2442623f" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"704afc7bcc7e">BR=E2=80=9119</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"83134225-5ec9-411f-b936-84ba829b10e8" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d5a3a0c72a46">The system shall email notify Finance Systems =
users when records are returned from Master Data</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"6140866b-a623-453d-a74d-102ef07af253">
<td data-local-id=3D"d9485739-2f8d-4c0a-a6a3-8434ef762d37" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"154a5939e14f">BR=E2=80=9120</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"389c5e61-9c08-4299-a351-29710e8004e5" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"10fbfc35bdaa">The system shall allow only Finance Systems us=
ers to edit all failure record fields (full edit access)</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"c8d8329f-21aa-4b57-a3f3-a93162d39b7e">
<td data-local-id=3D"23cdc9e7-d58a-43e9-bfe2-26d78b46fc0a" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e925be6bc015">BR=E2=80=9121</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a5fcf9d9-d368-4116-b57d-a85ba40565f9" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"231b021c86f8">The system shall allow Finance Systems users t=
o perform final review and resolution of records</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"1540181c-72b6-4a48-b5c7-0cfe322cd195">
<td data-local-id=3D"274f8914-e27d-40d5-9639-b286c0cabfc0" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ddc96ac29cb1">BR=E2=80=9122</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"bc3d4a89-7630-4891-bc92-47ed8eebcd4d" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"033999858867">The system shall allow Finance Systems users t=
o update records to <strong>=E2=80=9CClosed=E2=80=9D</strong> status after =
completing all actions</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"fda09565-2620-450e-94f6-08a6dc2e12f7">
<td data-local-id=3D"9e396673-beb9-404f-963e-68e27a09b278" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d27183ce224b">BR=E2=80=9123</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7bd312ab-1359-470c-adba-3fceeb913254" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"31fb694940b1">The system shall move records from an Open Rec=
ords list to a Closed Records list upon closure</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"b26e7ee0-46a6-4aa4-9cca-56cfeedacaa7">
<td data-local-id=3D"2e90a6b1-5d6d-4657-b208-f26fbe9e5a05" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c2f5a659e0ca">BR=E2=80=9124</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5a6ac952-6b2d-4dca-83b5-ee8ec30fb70d" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"82bf05259ca3">The system shall maintain distinct views for: =
Open Records, With Masterdata, With Finance Systems, and Closed Records</p>=
</td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"fa5fe8ff-2890-45a0-9650-6ef60e79d473">
<td data-local-id=3D"6accc08b-36ad-4b91-a11b-ffdc46efc7cd" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c8341dbe0be8">BR=E2=80=9125</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"85fd7c16-0553-4f73-852e-23b9b8ba2323" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"44904ba701ce">The system shall maintain a full audit trail o=
f all actions including creation, status changes, and notes</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"b6fb7177-645c-4845-a9bb-d7cdf84cfb3d">
<td data-local-id=3D"6066e388-aa87-4b0f-97dd-24fb7bf896c4" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fbfec9daaa61">BR=E2=80=9126</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7e27e1a4-db9b-478d-83eb-d5a1faf56e86" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a79cc0befae3">The system shall support grouped email generat=
ion based on failure type for efficient processing</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"4f297536-949d-41f2-93bc-3080a80850f3">
<td data-local-id=3D"584636b0-d62f-41ba-97bf-61ce3c48613b" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"55d57bb0839a">BR=E2=80=9127</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d1122a19-8334-4383-80f2-36c17262b618" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e97811f8c710">The system shall enforce failure classificatio=
n conditions as follows:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"2c658eec8cac">
<li local-id=3D"d80a81307839">
<p local-id=3D"c150d81d3998">Bad Fail =E2=86=92 No email</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"77a27c8995a4">
<p local-id=3D"9c5314727679">Missing Customer Translation =E2=86=92 Email t=
o Masterdata</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9c3d7fa7e630">
<p local-id=3D"00363994d04a">Missing Supplier Translation =E2=86=92 Email t=
o Masterdata</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2ae2602b3e8a">
<p local-id=3D"eb04d924b1db">Customer on Hold =E2=86=92 Email to Masterdata=
</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"cc29f4054423">
<p local-id=3D"72f482441b9c">Supplier on Hold =E2=86=92 Email to Masterdata=
</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"70362a4888db">
<p local-id=3D"785b5715eae7">Missing Client Fund Code =E2=86=92 No email</p=
></li>
<li local-id=3D"0b9980c77059">
<p local-id=3D"69a8c7d6f629">Period Closed =E2=86=92 No email</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d29431f49f48">
<p local-id=3D"f619689cced9">Other =E2=86=92 No email</p></li>
</ul></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"eb50de2f-0c2e-4e29-ac50-a65ba6bcc1cd">
<td data-local-id=3D"7927e692-6bdf-484c-86b7-a1b54f03374d" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"30d422a849e1">BR=E2=80=9128</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1fecdb79-0e80-4b35-ade9-b12a6aa7a33a" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b610b7fb05f9">The system shall ensure that only relevant rec=
ords (mapped to Master Data) are included in email generation</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"8bd3d180-5614-4747-b08c-7549fb10c96c">
<td data-local-id=3D"2dd32e40-d5f1-4a13-85dd-6364676277f3" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"83e0bb25122a">BR=E2=80=9129</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"682f8edf-d016-42ed-9a76-fc0e133dd843" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"dc1a3502bc22">The system should provide a notes/comments fie=
ld available to both Finance Systems and Master Data users for collaboratio=
n</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"97e471d2-69ad-46ba-a8e6-d3b8747efa0d">
<td data-local-id=3D"3690d236-4d59-4ee1-9e73-bd0de156bcb8" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b67663018621">BR=E2=80=9130</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e6156bee-285e-48f5-a8b2-5a448568fca5" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"56f5904f078f">The system shall enforce role-based access con=
trol between Finance Systems users and Master Data users</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"04e18df0-d7ea-4345-89e6-19f87c015067">
<td data-local-id=3D"86301b0a-346d-4dd3-a5e3-3681951a67da" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"86a76d7ae634">BR=E2=80=9131</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"173857ce-b606-47fe-83ba-e08833a18be8" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"662bb05059ef">The system shall allow reopening of records in=
 <strong>=E2=80=9CClosed=E2=80=9D</strong> status, subject to approval by t=
he Finance Systems Admin team</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"dcd2908956b4">
<td data-local-id=3D"1b9a248c38e2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"86f3e447c515">BR-32</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2d6fb27866d4" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9d1c933bccb1">The system shall allow Finance Systems users t=
o revert the status of a record from <strong>=E2=80=9CWith Finance Systems=
=E2=80=9D</strong> to <strong>=E2=80=9CWith Masterdata=E2=80=9D</strong> wh=
en further review or action is required</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"d21f8c0f3705">
<td data-local-id=3D"00987fbce511" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7ee020f93a1c">BR-33</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5ca129a9c5e2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0c6337ba5f6c">The system shall provide a <strong>KPI Dashboa=
rd</strong> to monitor integration failure performance and processing effic=
iency</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h2 local-id=3D"4a418838ab05" id=3D"FIONA_IntegrationFailureManagement_BRD_=
V1.0-7.Assumptions,Constraints&amp;Dependencies">7. Assumptions, Constraint=
s &amp; Dependencies</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"aae28c26ffcd" id=3D"FIONA_IntegrationFailureManagement_BRD_=
V1.0-Assumptions">Assumptions</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"d68a85df-593f-4cb7-a1d7-663575591d2c">
<li local-id=3D"aeba466b-d932-405a-8eb9-90d13bc997bb">
<p local-id=3D"9fcc18abf43f">Master Data users will have active access via =
Single Sign-On (SSO) to the system</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f01d0f60-663d-4ff0-978f-565b34e37855">
<p local-id=3D"6aa0340eec58">The system will be implemented without requiri=
ng historical data migration</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"da4cf7cb-e3eb-4e71-ad68-461504176a17">
<p local-id=3D"b302c5737970">Email infrastructure and services will be avai=
lable and operational for notifications</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"33fecc2e-ee61-4a44-bd69-97bcef5e11f1">
<p local-id=3D"304259e3f16e">Finance Systems and Master Data teams will fol=
low the defined process for status updates and ticket handling</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"5dd88ba061de" id=3D"FIONA_IntegrationFailureManagement_BRD_=
V1.0-Constraints">Constraints</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"7dab966c-be6a-4b9f-9666-6caea1c1ea76">
<li local-id=3D"0a974aba-bdf1-4e0b-8058-cd48d871a57b">
<p local-id=3D"9f1c31b56f63">Email templates, formats, and distribution rul=
es will be defined and managed outside the system</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"81f65560-e249-4c5b-bd8e-35053dde3717">
<p local-id=3D"2124c3d7f7b6">Reopening of closed records will be restricted=
 and subject to formal approval by the Finance Systems Admin team</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f2a5b860-3106-4255-9537-623080e00402">
<p local-id=3D"8d062811d65e">Master Data users will have limited access, re=
stricted to status updates and notes only (no field-level edits)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c55042c9-fc2a-4ec3-87d5-9f89970145b0">
<p local-id=3D"0ef5f36987ec">Status transitions will be controlled and role=
-based, preventing unauthorized changes</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8711cf7a-44c1-4797-928e-73463e48c154">
<p local-id=3D"f917c0348b87">The system must align with existing IT securit=
y, access control, and audit compliance policies</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"c19257a675a6" id=3D"FIONA_IntegrationFailureManagement_BRD_=
V1.0-Dependencies">Dependencies</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"733f378c-6366-4bf3-913d-e8fa9db45342">
<li local-id=3D"3dcd0022-cd6b-46bf-926c-4f8418f110c9">
<p local-id=3D"dbe375782d6d">Completion of email configuration and distribu=
tion lists setup by IT teams</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"60b060d5-7f50-4494-bb75-a48d1a5cfc21">
<p local-id=3D"33bfa2b6cffa">Provision and maintenance of an accurate Maste=
r Data user list and access roles</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9fa4c901-69a4-465d-b097-c27a963a0c22">
<p local-id=3D"18d14980f679">Integration readiness of email systems and aut=
hentication services (SSO)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1871c2c4-e6ab-41f4-b637-9e95f3091fcf">
<p local-id=3D"2bdf9f40b9ab">Timely definition and approval of failure type=
 mappings and notification rules</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"e82177203b3d" id=3D"FIONA_IntegrationFailureManagement_BRD_=
V1.0-8.Risks&amp;Mitigation">8. Risks &amp; Mitigation</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"869" data-layout=3D"align-start" data-local-id=
=3D"29fb7b36-3a10-421f-ac37-f6b66f741c5a" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"3d3e0e9b-7391-43be-926b-3c4607477699">
<th data-local-id=3D"fad48fb8-1ade-4f8d-897d-a1c1db96a8c3" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"ba5a68e234f3"><strong>Risk</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"5ab52ea1-f137-4df6-8211-6e71ccd8862c" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"fd0b928db564"><strong>Mitigation</strong></p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"8b94f89a-a8f4-4d5e-8b78-7558ed4a321d">
<td data-local-id=3D"f7d2dc0b-9a70-4500-b868-ea8f4a4060f2" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"10d96c4fa2cb">Incorrect failure classification</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c44ec214-bc82-4800-8584-fbcf4eaa3bb8" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d27058f66968">Provide predefined failure type mapping and va=
lidation</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"9379fd2c-36ba-4a63-ac4b-34c4ef747163">
<td data-local-id=3D"d3301908-c573-4a61-bf4a-f506cc843b63" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ce103cbd2de0">Missing ticket numbers</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7ae7528c-cb2d-490b-951a-86ce19dd936c" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2efc84f83f12">Enforce mandatory field before enabling action=
s</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"dd7751ca-5163-405f-95bd-ee734c4fc7ed">
<td data-local-id=3D"6cf0980a-c726-4112-a6d7-91e39929bafc" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"66eacec45ecd">Email failures or delays</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"6b9da2a3-0b05-42b1-a790-81248243fbf9" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0010d14d9cfb">Implement retry mechanism and monitoring alert=
s</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"7bbddde3-1cb8-4805-adef-5bcf5ba2fca3">
<td data-local-id=3D"64a3af40-84c3-4fcd-a8a6-04c698938090" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"16d2d95b2246">Unauthorized access or updates</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"efe52d7d-4f43-4211-9ab2-82c56d413a4d" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"80834ce09e09">Apply role-based access control (RBAC)</p></td=
>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"9acee030-ae62-4f08-9342-6c6a2e5dcad8">
<td data-local-id=3D"3b5534db-a1b5-44ba-9798-415d4bb73eee" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a88aa55446f5">Delays in Master Data response</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2d7729de-aece-492a-978b-5aa4c2189caf" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"81b7af69cbc8">Track aging and highlight overdue records in d=
ashboard</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"55641338-6d27-4648-853c-68b990a018c9">
<td data-local-id=3D"0af74926-ed47-4ab9-9958-2ba76f672c9b" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"aafb8f0e8877">Data inconsistency</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b01f319f-1dd7-4766-84ae-663bd0d9fe85" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"05625ade01ea">Maintain audit trail and validation controls</=
p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"2fbac194-f362-4342-b093-8d8096ff07d5">
<td data-local-id=3D"8e725e6f-122d-49d9-b31c-047ccf24ab0a" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"15f0e4beb339">Dependency on email configuration</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1d6c441b-b734-446d-906e-44cb6b2e32ac" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fb307541b562">Ensure IT setup and testing before go=E2=80=91=
live</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h2 local-id=3D"7ab06cd97fc0" id=3D"FIONA_IntegrationFailureManagement_BRD_=
V1.0-9.SuccessCriteria">9. Success Criteria</h2>
<p local-id=3D"804be96cd683">The solution will be successful when:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"f10f931a-00db-4f5f-adfa-7e63b922d2d1">
<li local-id=3D"dedc9422-cf59-45e6-b39e-60d71c95f5c9">
<p local-id=3D"e57b5910ebf2">All failures are recorded in FIONA</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"0f282706-f838-4231-bb4a-ac41b4f433e6">
<p local-id=3D"836dc2c03336">Excel workbook is no longer used</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e20d1993-b0c1-4c40-86fc-cb87cc854345">
<p local-id=3D"bf2d7e7cd3a9">Email notifications work as expected</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"0526b4ea-eb4d-48b7-9a11-e12313ca5896">
<p local-id=3D"0f63ea9702ba">Each record has a clear status</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"00c487d0-b6ee-4b92-9f6d-d857f7272faa">
<p local-id=3D"6b60adeec582">Manual emails are reduced</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e61e9084-ec11-4ceb-bbe4-f53651299d70">
<p local-id=3D"d287fc6542a2">Reporting is possible based on system data</p>=
</li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"00f1b84c38fd" id=3D"FIONA_IntegrationFailureManagement_BRD_=
V1.0-10.Appendices">10. Appendices</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"5970743a4c13" id=3D"FIONA_IntegrationFailureManagement_BRD_=
V1.0-Glossary">Glossary</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"834b65b2d2be">
<li local-id=3D"a33be20d-b75f-4fb4-94c7-a4ee938118e2">
<p local-id=3D"5a2cf4532087"><strong>Integration Failure</strong>: Error du=
ring data transfer between systems</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"57d58dbf-f4b8-4d7e-bf4b-9eaa868f2c30">
<p local-id=3D"288a24beaac3"><strong>FS (Finance Systems)</strong>: Team re=
sponsible for resolving failures</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"99d3eef7-9d1a-4cfe-ab5f-6081a3232683">
<p local-id=3D"2d21c1a03a36"><strong>Master Data</strong>: Team handling da=
ta corrections (e.g., mappings)</p></li>
